and a place is yours.\" Some apprentices, they say, want the Corps more than they want the boon."]},{"x":112,"y":176,"r":44,"title":"the arcane library","verb":"Read","kind":"note","pages":["Treatises on incantation and evocation, on arrays of three points and five, on the trapping of fey beasts in cold iron. The lowest shelves are chained shut — bindings and summonings, the workings an apprentice is forbidden to attempt alone. A whole shelf's worth of them is missing."]},{"x":1136,"y":240,"r":44,"title":"the casting circle","verb":"Examine","kind":"note","pages":["A granite floor scored with arcane circles — formulae given physical form, written in special ink. Apprentices prepare their workings here, sealed and warded from all intrusion. One such preparation, some years past, went so catastrophically wrong the masters will not speak of it above a whisper."]},{"x":1136,"y":528,"r":44,"title":"the memorial","verb":"Read","kind":"plaque","pages":["A plaque, and beneath it fresh flowers. \"In memory of the apprentices lost at the tests: BRUELOS. GERSIMO. THAMI. RAZA. ILLELLI. EMRYS. And the grandmaster who burned holding the fire back.\"","Below, a line has been chiselled out and left blank. \"The one who summoned it was not executed, but banished — a greater demon sealed within his own heart, to carry until he can be rid of it. His name is struck from every roll of this Academy.\""]},{"x":1264,"y":624,"r":44,"title":"a warded door","verb":"Examine","kind":"note","pages":["A low door sealed with arcane script that hums faintly under your hand. Whatever the Academy keeps behind it is not for apprentices — nor, by the look of the seals, is it meant to get out."]}],"containers":[],"discoveries":[],"arches":[],"creatures":[]},"seoshe":{"name":"The Approach","cols":56,"rows":40,"tile":32,"tiles":["########################################################","########################################################","########################################################","#